      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The SELECT deletion criterion requires `modeled` to stay open when no hint proves it, but `closeSide` also closes it with `assumption` when a matching local hypothesis exists. Fix: Require `sql_run` to enter the continuation and leave `modeled` as a separate goal only when neither a hint nor a local hypothesis discharges it."
